# Frontend build-time environment variables (Vite).
# Copy to .env.local for local overrides, or set in your native build pipeline.

# Absolute backend base URL — REQUIRED for Capacitor (iOS/Android) builds, since the native
# shell serves web assets locally and cannot use relative /api paths.
# Leave UNSET for web/PWA (same-origin) builds. No trailing slash.
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-app.up.railway.app
